{"id":"sl/m1wvqtk3","index":21,"layout":{"id":"ly/bqdgbyxk","name":"THREE COLUMNS 2 "},"title":"Uso operativo del sistema de soporte a la decisión","elements":[{"id":"sh/9o7m903e","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/872hozit","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/t8byh4je","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/yh0zip0r","kind":"shape"},{"id":"im/sr2t4nyt","kind":"image","name":"Google Shape;576;p15"},{"id":"im/tsvaxsfe","kind":"image","name":"Google Shape;577;p15"},{"id":"im/ut4b6xgz","kind":"image","name":"Google Shape;578;p15"},{"id":"im/fudszix4","kind":"image","name":"Google Shape;579;p15"},{"id":"sh/qtcvi1gb","kind":"textbox","name":"slide-title","text":"Uso operativo del sistema de soporte a la decisión"},{"id":"sh/ru5wb6hw","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/svedkbyh","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/dwnedgzm","kind":"textbox","text":"01"},{"id":"sh/ehwvmlg7","kind":"textbox","text":"Actualizar datos"},{"id":"sh/fi5wfqhs","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/0jedobyd","kind":"textbox","text":"02"},{"id":"sh/1knehgzy","kind":"textbox","text":"Verificar cobertura"},{"id":"sh/2lwvqlgj","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/nmpwjqh4","kind":"textbox","text":"03"},{"id":"sh/xgry9kj6","kind":"textbox","text":"Emitir pronóstico"},{"id":"sh/cfihgfil","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/be9gna10","kind":"textbox","text":"04"},{"id":"sh/ad0zep0f","kind":"textbox","text":"Revisar riesgo"},{"id":"sh/lkryd4j2","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/kjihkzih","kind":"textbox","text":"05"},{"id":"sh/zi9gbu1c","kind":"textbox","text":"Decidir y registrar"},{"id":"sh/8nyl0v29","kind":"textbox","text":"La salida constituye un insumo de consulta. El pronóstico histórico incluido en la tesis no representa un presupuesto vigente."}],"notes":{"text":"Fuente: C:\\Python\\tesis\\documentacion\\TESIS_OCT2026_Rev68_(ZUJ)_Final.docx, párrafo 673 y apartados 3.8.7 y 4.8.3."}}
{"id":"sl/5onypobq","index":22,"layout":{"id":"ly/2t4jax8v","name":"THREE COLUMNS + INFOGRAPHY"},"title":"Conclusiones","elements":[{"id":"im/lw7ads3i","kind":"image","name":"Google Shape;668;p22"},{"id":"im/kvytkn2d","kind":"image","name":"Google Shape;669;p22"},{"id":"im/i187ep0v","kind":"image","name":"Google Shape;670;p22"},{"id":"im/32ho7u10","kind":"image","name":"Google Shape;671;p22"},{"id":"sh/hgzqpkn6","kind":"textbox","name":"slide-title","text":"Conclusiones"},{"id":"sh/wfqpwfml","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/ji18ra5c","kind":"textbox","text":"El pipeline integra compras, ventas y calendario, genera pronósticos de uno a cuatro pasos y concilia la asignación por insumo.\nEl híbrido no domina todos los horizontes. Solo logra el menor RMSE entre los comparadores principales a tres semanas.\nLa composición alterna entre el método histórico y el promedio temporal ponderado, sin un ganador general.\nLa muestra reducida y la cobertura no certificada impiden una conclusión confirmatoria sobre H1.\nEl resultado sirve como apoyo revisable para la planeación, no como orden automática de compra."}],"notes":{"text":"Fuente: C:\\Python\\tesis\\documentacion\\TESIS_OCT2026_Rev68_(ZUJ)_Final.docx, párrafos 670 a 673."}}
